  - elementId: locktitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [518, 308, 360, 22]
    content: {style: "$cardtitle", fontSize: 15, wrap: false, text: 并发控制：两人同时抢一单怎么办？}
  - elementId: lockbody
    elementType: text
    bounds: [518, 338, 364, 160]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>· 接单事务内 <span style="color:$primary"><strong>SELECT … FOR UPDATE</strong></span> 锁定任务行</p>
        <p>· 更新时带状态前置条件（WHERE task_status = 'WAITING'），受影响行数为 0 即失败</p>
        <p>· 数据库唯一约束兜底，杜绝超卖</p>
        <p>· 全程显式事务，异常自动回滚</p>
